    <description>7.24.26 : SS-9566 - Add a filter condition to check if the Product in Subscription is Included in ARR, If yes then send the Tanium Expiration Notice. 
6.25.26 : SS-9566 - The &quot;Tanium Expiration Notice&quot; email is sent only when the contract has at least one renewable subscription and not when it contains only one-time subscriptions.
04.20.26: SS-13069 Updated Recipients_with_Null_Check formula with new Primary Opportunity Contact field, removing dependencies to uninstalled managed package.
Migrated from Renewal Notification email to Custom and Tanium Flow
03.04.26 AT: SS-12399: Removing commented-out recipients in Recipients_with_Null_Check formula.
07.14.25 AT: Updates to Recipients with Null Check formula SS-11293</description>
