    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBodyCustomer</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;img src=&quot;https://tanium--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0157V000003xkJW&amp;oid=00DRL000006Bjcf&amp;lastMod=1694729105000&quot; alt=&quot;Tanium Logo for Emails.png&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Dear {!$Record.Account.Name},&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
This is a friendly reminder that your Tanium software license or support entitlement is expiring on  {!Get_Latest_Contract.EndDate}.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
If you are already working on your renewal with your Account Manager and/or Tanium authorized partner, no further action is required.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
To continue using Tanium and/or receiving support without any interruption, please contact your Account Manager (included on this email) as soon as possible but no later than the expiration date of your current software license or support entitlement noted above.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
If you elect to purchase Tanium’s products and services indirectly through a Tanium authorized partner, please work with your partner to facilitate your renewal order. Otherwise, your Account Manager will be able to address any questions or concerns about the renewal process and assist you with any issues that you may encounter.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Thank you for being a valued customer of Tanium. We appreciate your business and look forward to hearing from you.
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Regards,&lt;br&gt;
Tanium Licensing</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Renewal_Notification_Opportunity_Owner</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Your Customer, {!$Record.Account.Name}, has Tanium software license or support entitlements expiring on {!Get_Latest_Contract.EndDate}.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
You will be included on an automated email sent to the Customer reminding them of their upcoming license expiration. They will be reminded up to 3 times – 30, 60, and 90 days before the license expiration.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
ACTION ITEMS:&lt;br&gt;
Please review the following fields on the renewal opportunity (link provided below) and ensure these contacts are accurate and connected to valid email addresses:&lt;br&gt;

• Primary Opportunity Contact&lt;br&gt;
• Procurement Contact&lt;br&gt;
• Economic Buyer&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Please also review the Opportunity Team section of your opportunity so the correct people are included in the notification. For more information, please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://tanium.sharepoint.com/sites/GTMHub-Center%20of%20Excellence/SitePages/Renewals.aspx&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Renewals page&lt;/a&gt; on the COE SharePoint.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;

Opportunity Name: &lt;a href=&quot;{!Oppty_RecordLink_Formula}&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Name}&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Contract Number: &lt;a href=&quot;{!Contract_RecordLink_Formula}&quot;&gt;{!Get_Latest_Contract.ContractNumber}&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
{!formula_180_MEDDPICC}
&lt;br&gt;
Thank you!</text>
    </textTemplates>
